      "concerns": "Structurally entangled with command-tree (legacyArgs is called directly from command.go; every validator takes *Command), but this is an intentional plugin-policy pattern (Command.Args holds a PositionalArgs value), not an accidental coupling. Most exported validators besides NoArgs/MinimumNArgs have no non-test in-repo caller; they are entrypoints because they are Cobra's public library API for external CLI authors."
